"are now aliases for ``--fetch-python=missing`` / "
"``PIPX_FETCH_PYTHON=missing``. ``PIPX_FETCH_MISSING_PYTHON=0`` (and other "
"falsy values) now disables fetching, where previously any value enabled it. "
"The ``pipx.interpreter.find_python_interpreter`` keyword "
"``fetch_missing_python: bool`` is replaced by ``fetch_python: "
"FetchPythonOptions``. (:pr:`1663`) by :user:`13steinj` "
"and :user:`gaborbernat`"
msgstr ""

