#: ../../../changelog.rst:2642
msgid ""
"Upgrade instructions: When upgrading to 0.15.0.0 or above from a "
"pre-0.15.0.0 version, you must re-install all packages to take advantage of "
"the new persistent pipx metadata files introduced in this release. These "
"metadata files store pip specification values, injected packages, any custom "
"pip arguments, and more in each main package's venv. You can do this by "
"running ``pipx reinstall-all`` or ``pipx uninstall-all``, then reinstalling "
"manually."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../changelog.rst:2646
